@Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Health Check
GET {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/health

### Readiness Check
GET {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Inference — Success
POST {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json
X-Gateway-Key: key-client-a

{
  "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro",
  "inputs": "The quick brown fox",
  "parameters": {
    "max_new_tokens": 50,
    "temperature": 0.7
  }
}

### Inference — Unauthorized (missing API key)
POST {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro",
  "inputs": "test"
}

### Inference — Unauthorized (invalid API key)
POST {{Resilient_AI_Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/v1/inference
Content-Type: application/json
X-Gateway-Key: invalid-key

{
  "model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro",
  "inputs": "test"
}
